// Registry Modification of MS-settings Protocol Handler | T1112, T1546.001, T1548.002 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_susp_registry_modification_of_ms_setting_protocol_handler.yml
(((process.executable.caseless:*\\reg.exe OR process.pe.original_file_name:reg.exe) AND process.command_line:*add*) OR (((process.executable.caseless:(*\\powershell.exe OR *\\pwsh.exe)) OR (process.pe.original_file_name:(powershell.exe OR pwsh.dll))) AND (process.command_line:(*New\-ItemProperty* OR *Set\-ItemProperty* OR *ni\ * OR *sp\ *)))) AND process.command_line:*\\ms\-settings\\shell\\open\\command*
